<!-- ================= SERVICES ================= -->
<section class="band" id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our Complete Gate &amp; Door Services</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Everything to Keep Your Gates Secure and Doors Working</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">We offer a comprehensive range of gate and door services across New Orleans, from installation and automation to fast repairs and preventative maintenance.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M3 11h18M8 7v13M16 7v13"/></svg><h3>Swing Gates</h3><p>We repair and install traditional swing gates in wood, iron, or vinyl, sized and finished for your entrance.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 6h16v12H4z"/><path d="M4 12h16M9 6v12"/></svg><h3>Slide Gates</h3><p>Space-saving automatic slide gates, perfect for driveways with limited room to swing.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M5 5l2 2M17 17l2 2M19 5l-2 2M7 17l-2 2"/></svg><h3>Gate Openers</h3><p>We repair existing openers, install brand-new ones, and program remotes for convenient, secure access.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M14 7l-1.5-1.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3 0l-6 6 3 3 6-6a2.1 2.1 0 0 0 0-3z"/><path d="m9 11 4 4 6-6-3-3"/></svg><h3>Gate Hardware</h3><p>Broken hinges, rollers, or damaged tracks? We replace faulty hardware to get your gate working properly again.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="11"/><path d="M3 9l2-5h14l2 5M7 9v11M12 9v11M17 9v11"/></svg><h3>Garage Doors</h3><p>From broken springs and opener faults to damaged panels, we fix garage door problems and install new doors.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="1.2"/></svg><h3>Security Doors</h3><p>Keep entryways safe with security door repair and installation, plus hinge, lock, and closer fixes.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="6" y="3" width="12" height="18" rx="1"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="12" r="1.1"/></svg><h3>Interior Doors</h3><p>Sticking interior doors or faulty doorknobs? We fix any issue to keep your interior doors working smoothly.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4-3 7-7 9-4-2-7-5-7-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg><h3>Preventative Maintenance</h3><p>We don't just fix the problem, we prevent it. Maintenance plans keep your gates and doors in top condition.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

