<!-- ================= TESTIMONIALS ================= -->
<section class="band band--sand" id="testimonials"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Rated by Thousands of Satisfied Customers</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">What New Orleans Homeowners Say</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">Real reviews from property owners across the metro who trusted TurnKey Gates with their gates, doors, and fences.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="rev-carousel">
    <div class="rev-nav">
      <button class="rev-arrow" type="button" aria-label="Previous testimonials" onclick="revScroll(-1)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button>
      <button class="rev-arrow" type="button" aria-label="Next testimonials" onclick="revScroll(1)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button>
    </div>
    <div class="rev-track" id="revtrack">
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>I am absolutely thrilled with the installation of my new electric gate by TurnKey Gates! It adds an extra layer of security to my property, and the craftsmanship is top-notch. Their team was professional and efficient throughout the process.</p><div class="who"><img class="av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Electric driveway gate project"><div><b>Electric Gate Install</b><span>New Orleans homeowner</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>They did a fantastic job installing a beautiful swing gate for my home. The attention to detail and the quality of the materials used are impressive. I highly recommend them.</p><div class="who"><img class="av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Swing gate project"><div><b>Swing Gate Install</b><span>Metairie homeowner</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>Their team turned my vision into reality with a custom sliding gate that perfectly complements my property's aesthetics. This gate has truly enhanced both the security and beauty of my home.</p><div class="who"><img class="av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Custom sliding gate project"><div><b>Custom Sliding Gate</b><span>Kenner homeowner</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>Their team installed a robust double gate for my driveway, which gives me peace of mind. The gate's functionality and sturdiness are unmatched, showcasing their commitment to quality work.</p><div class="who"><img class="av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Double driveway gate project"><div><b>Double Driveway Gate</b><span>Slidell homeowner</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>I chose their wood fences for my backyard, and they've transformed the space into a private oasis. The installation was quick, and the final result exceeded my expectations!</p><div class="who"><img class="av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Wood fence project"><div><b>Wood Fence Install</b><span>Covington homeowner</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>Thumbs up to TurnKey Gates for their expertise in installing interior railings. The railings not only enhance safety but also add an artistic element to my home's interior. I can't recommend them enough!</p><div class="who"><img class="av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Interior railing project"><div><b>Karen R.</b><span>Interior Railings</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= ABOUT / TRUST ================= -->
<section class="band band--slate" id="about"><div class="about-bg"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""></div><div class="wrap">
  <div class="about">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#e4c49c">Trusted &amp; Reliable</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title" style="color:#fff">Your New Orleans Gate and Door Experts</h2>
      <p>Keep your Big Easy property secure and stylish with TurnKey Gates. We're a local company specializing in residential and commercial gate and door installation and repair. Our experienced technicians use the latest technology to ensure your gate functions flawlessly and adds curb appeal.</p>
      <p>Whether you need a driveway gate, a security gate, or any other gate solution, TurnKey Gates is your trusted partner. We're committed to enhancing your property's security and aesthetics with top-quality gate and door services.</p>
    </div>
