<!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->
<section class="band band--sand"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Answers Before You Build</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <details open><summary>I'm thinking about adding a new gate. What types of gates do you install?</summary><div class="a">We install a variety of gates to suit your needs and style. Popular options include swing gates in wood, iron, or vinyl, and space-saving automatic slide gates ideal for driveways.</div></details>
    <details><summary>How can I improve the security of my entry points?</summary><div class="a">We offer security door repair and installation services. We can address hinge issues, replace locks, and fix broken door closers to ensure your entryways are secure.</div></details>
    <details><summary>Do you offer any preventative maintenance services?</summary><div class="a">Yes, we do! Regular maintenance keeps your gates and doors functioning smoothly and prevents costly repairs down the road. We offer preventative maintenance plans for your peace of mind.</div></details>
    <details><summary>My automatic gate opener isn't working properly. Do you repair openers?</summary><div class="a">Yes! We can diagnose and repair existing openers or install a brand-new one. We also program remotes for easy access.</div></details>
    <details><summary>My garage door spring broke. Can you replace it?</summary><div class="a">Of course! Broken springs are a common issue, and our technicians are experts at replacing them safely and efficiently. We can also fix other garage door problems like opener malfunctions or damaged panels.</div></details>
    <details><summary>How can I get a free quote for gate or door service?</summary><div class="a">Simply contact TurnKey Gates! We offer free consultations and quotes. We're happy to discuss your specific needs and recommend the best solution for your property.</div></details>
  </div>
</div></section>

